# Pinned upstream archives: <glpi-tag>  <sha256 of the GitHub archive tarball>
#
# GitHub archive checksums are stable in practice but not guaranteed by GitHub.
# If you need a hard guarantee, switch the download to the release asset
# (glpi-<version>.tgz) published on the GitHub release page.
#
# Add entries with: ./ci/pin-version.sh <version>
